    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eLNMU UG Admission Online Form 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-05-19T15:06:34+05:30\"\u003eMay 19, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e3:06 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://lnmu.ac.in/\"\u003eLalit Narayan Mithila University (LNMU)\u003c/a\u003e, \u003c/strong\u003ehas released a\u003cstrong\u003e notification \u003c/strong\u003eon its official website for the\u003cb\u003e Admission\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;to the \u003cstrong\u003eUndergraduate (UG)/ Graduation/ Degree Course (B.A/ B.Sc/ B.Com) 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e The \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU\u003c/strong\u003e application has started on \u003cstrong\u003e25 May 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and candidates can fill out the form until\u003cstrong\u003e 09 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates must check the complete details for the \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU UG Admission Online Form 2026-30\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;which are given below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eLNMU UG Online Form 2026\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eLNMU UG Examination 2026 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/lnmu-ug-admission-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date : \u003cb\u003e25 May 2026\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eLast Date for Apply Online :\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e 09 June 2026\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003eLast Date Online Payment :\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003e10 – 11 June 2026\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCorrection Date : \u003cstrong\u003e12 – 13 June 2026\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"\u003e1st Merit List : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eGeneral/ OBC\u003c/strong\u003e : \u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e₹\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e500/-\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor \u003cstrong\u003eSC/ ST/ PH Candidates\u003c/strong\u003e : \u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e₹ \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e500/-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eLNMU UG Online Form 2026 : Age Limits As On LNMU Rules.\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eN/A\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eN/A\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCheck More Details For LNMU UG 2026 Visit Official Website.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003eNA\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eLNMU UG Online Form 2026 : Admission Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;LNMU UG Online Form 2026 : Eligibility Criteria\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 24.8004%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUG Arts\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 75.1996%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates who have passed the Intermediate (I.A., I.Sc., or I.Com) or 10+2 exam from the Bihar School Examination Board or any other recognized national or state board are eligible.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 24.8004%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUG Science\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 75.1996%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates who have passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam—whether I.A., I.Sc., or I.Com—from the Bihar School Examination Board or any other recognized national or state board are eligible.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 24.8004%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUG Commerce\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 75.1996%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates who have passed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam in the Science stream (I.Sc.) from the Bihar School Examination Board or any other recognized national or state board are eligible.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;LNMU UG Online Form 2026 : Affiliated Colleges\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eC. M. College, Darbhanga\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eB. R. B. College, Samastipur\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eR. K. College, Madhubani\u003c/span\u0