g\u003e start?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The online application for this exam has Started On \u003cstrong\u003e25 May 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the last date for \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU UG\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Online Form 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The last date to apply online for this exam is \u003cstrong\u003e09 June 2026.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the age limit for \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU UG \u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnline Form 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The age limit for candidates applying for this exam is as per the \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU UG\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;rules. For detailed age-related information, refer to the official notification.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the eligibility for \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU UG\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Online Form 2026\u003c/strong\u003e?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u0026nbsp; \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates who have passed the Intermediate (I.A., I.Sc., or I.Com) or 10+2 exam from the Bihar School Examination Board or any other recognized national or state board are eligible.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuestion:\u003c/strong\u003e What is the official website of \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU ?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer:\u003c/strong\u003e The official website of \u003cstrong\u003eLNMU \u003c/strong\u003eis \u003cstrong\u003ehttps://lnmu.ac.in/\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-35192 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-19T150606.349-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"LNMU UG Admission Online Form 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-19T150606.349-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-19T150606.349-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-2026-05-19T150606.349-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-200